    {
      "title": "[P2] Reset migrated fixture state before enabling retries",
      "body": "Spreading `baseConfig` inherits `retries: 2` in CI, but these migrated tests permanently acknowledge reports, resolve conflicts, and widen grants in the shared database. If a test fails after one of those mutations, its retry starts against the already-modified fixture—for example, the Acknowledge button is gone—and cannot pass; reset/reseed state between attempts or make these tests idempotent before inheriting retries.",
      "confidence_score": 0.93,
      "priority": 2,
